                <pb facs="0495" n="407" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg407"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/734: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Peru</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Dearing</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-01-18T13:00:00-05:00">January 18, 1933—1
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>14. Your telegram No. 21, January 15, 11 a.m. Please endeavor to obtain from the
                    Brazilian Minister a copy of his note to Peru of January 13, and cable the
                    Department the text thereof. Also text of Peruvian reply.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
